                                        "entry_id": "9584cb8f-53a0-334e-88be-bde98f64ae03",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tendency to play the victim; the adoption of a victimized persona."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
